%LC理
\dDo you even need to ask?\nI mean, we were married once.\d%K%P
「理所当然的事情就不要问了吧…\n因为，我们可是曾经结过婚的关系啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理…」%K%P
I... didn't know what to do.%K%P
其实我只是不知道怎么办才好。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu... you really are a foolish man, aren't you?\d%K%P
「呐，理…\n你啊，还真是傻呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, that's why I got divorced.\d%K%P
「所以才被写了休书啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, no, I'm sorry!\nI meant, I got laid off! Let's go with that!\d%K%P
「啊，不对，对不起搞错了！\n刚才想说『被裁员了』！」%K%P
I didn't know how to react, so I ended up mixing\ngratitude, sarcasm, jokes, and honest feelings into one\nconfusing blend of an answer.%K%P
因为不知道怎么做才好，\n感谢、挖苦、打趣话、真心话，\n同时从嘴里蹦了出来。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, you're not wrong.\nIt's true that I've done something unforgivable to you.\d%K%P
「不不，没有弄错。\n我对你做的是一辈子也磨灭不掉的残酷…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBy the way! What about your house?\nAre you sure you have time to waste on me right now?\d%K%P
「那种事还是不提了吧！\n话说麻实你的房子怎么办啊？\n现在不是在意我的时候吧？」%K%P
I knew my quick changing of the subject felt forced, but I\nwas confident I could make it work, seeing how it was a\nfairly legitimate question.%K%P
这么生硬地转换话题也是没有办法的办法，\n不过现在只能说完全正确的话的我也只好将错就错。%K%P
After all, Asami was clearly the one who had lost the most\nin that fire.%K%P
不管怎么考虑，\n都是没了住的地方，也没了财产的麻实的事更要紧，这个是不会错的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's okay. I had everything insured. It will probably\ntake some time, but I should have most of the value back\neventually.\d%K%P
「没关系的，保险公司的人会打点好一切的。\n稍微等一段时间，财产差不多能全额赔给我」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat sounds good, but what are you planning to do right\nnow? Will your real estate agent prepare a new place for\nyou in exchange or something?\d%K%P
「以后的事情不说，现在你准备怎么办？\n他们有提供给你新的住房吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI wonder. I haven't spoken to them yet, so I don't know.\d%K%P
「到底有没有呢？\n我还没提这事，所以也不清楚」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou should talk to them as soon as possible. Nothing good\ncomes from just accepting things as they are.\n...Especially when it comes to you, Asami. I know you have\na hard time being assertive.\d%K%P
「最好明确提出来。\n忍气吞声可不好。\n…麻实本来就说不出那种强硬的话」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't think I'm any worse off than you. Now that I\nthink about it, we were subscribed to five different\nnewspapers at one point, weren't we...?\d%K%P
「你也是毫不逊色啊。\n这么说来，有一次我们两人都不会拒绝，结果买了五份报纸…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-That's in the past...\d%K%P
「不，这种老远的事…」%K%P
I almost teared up from sheer nostalgia, so I kinda wished\nshe'd give it a rest.%K%P
太过怀念，想起来就想哭，所以还是别再说了…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I have a month until you're free from that cast.\nI'll use that time to carefully think everything through.\d%K%P
「嘛，还要一个月石膏才能取下来，\n用这段时间慢慢考虑吧」%K%P
Ah...%K%P
完了…%K%P
She had already made up her mind before I could even try\nand dissuade her from wasting precious time on me.%K%P
『不要总是照顾我啊』，\n这句我说出来就能取胜的台词胎死腹中了…%K%P
No getting out of this, then... I knew she would never\ngive in.%K%P
但现在看来已经无法挽回了。\n想要从言辞上战胜麻实，\n怎么就这么难…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dR-Right... Did any of your things survive?\d%K%P
「说、说起来，火灾剩下来的东西呢…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell... Yesterday evening, I went to the area where my\nhouse used to be, but all I could find was ash.\d%K%P
「那个啊…\n傍晚的时候我去现场看了看，\n可惜全部一个不剩地变成碳了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「额…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt doesn't matter.\nMost of those things were old and cheap, anyway.\d%K%P
「没什么，都是有些年代的玩意了。\n而且都不贵」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
I witnessed the insides of her apartment for but a few\nseconds before the flames consumed it all, but...%K%P
在麻实房间燃烧前数秒，我看到了里面的样子。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I suppose it was a bit... sad to lose them all.\n...After all, they were all cheap and... very old.\d%K%P
「嘛，虽然还是有那么一点难过。\n…不过再怎么说，那也全都是便宜的老东西」%K%P
The oak cupboard.\nThe white round table.\nThe closet with one handle missing.%K%P
橡木的碗柜。\n白色的圆桌。\n掉了一边把手的壁橱。%K%P
The familiar covers sizzling on the shelf.\nThat bulky 27-inch CRT TV.%K%P
书柜里整整齐齐地收录着的我所熟知的书脊。\n随意摆放的２７寸电视。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Asami...\d%K%P
「我说，麻实」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Yes?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
The cups we picked together on our marriage anniversary\nlying shattered on the floor...%K%P
从碗柜里掉出来的…是两个人一起挑选的，为以后生活准备的碗。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...No, it's nothing.\d%K%P
「…不，没什么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
It was nothing.%K%P
没什么。%K%P
Pieces of furniture just a bit too large for someone\nliving alone.%K%P
那些只一个人生活用未免太大的家具。%K%P
All of them showing signs of heavy use, and being cheap\nenough to be afforded with the salary of an office clerk\nfresh on the job.%K%P
每一件家具都是用了有些年份的，\n而且都是刚入职场的员工也能买得起的便宜货。%K%P
One normally wouldn't keep all that just for the sake of\nconvenience, or because they felt it'd be a waste to throw\nthem away.%K%P
仅靠『细心使用』是不能用这么久的。\n仅靠『丢掉太可惜』这个理由是无法坚持用下去的。%K%P
All of those... were a part of our old life together.%K%P
而且每一件…都是我们两人曾经一起生活时候的东西。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI admit they were all things with memories attached to\nthem, but...\d%K%P
「不过每一个物件，都有着回忆就是了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut the very thing that provided them with all those\nmemories survived just fine, so it doesn't really\nmatter...\d%K%P
「但是，每一件回忆所依附的“东西”\n现在是平安无事的…\n所以，这就足够了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
Did she mean...%K%P
这…也就是说…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, I'm finished with your front.\nYou can take off your pants and underwear now.\d%K%P
「好，上半身擦完了。\n现在把裤子和内裤脱了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't need to do that!\nI'm perfectly able to take care of that myself!\d%K%P
「那里不擦也行的！\n从一开始就该我自己擦的吧！」%K%P
At that moment, a terrifying thought crossed my mind...%K%P
这个瞬间，我意识到一件可怕的事情。%K%P
What would happen... when I needed to go to the toilet?%K%P
去厕所的时候…她是不是也要跟来？%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThat's not what I meant!\d%K%P
「所以我不都说过了吗！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Phew.\d%K%P
「…啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm really sorry for causing you all this trouble.\d%K%P
「真是抱歉了。\n在各方面都给你们添麻烦了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Slurp.\d%K%P
「…（饮水声）」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYour house has burned down!\nYou're the one in trouble here!\d%K%P
「你住的地方被烧了吧？\n你自己才是最辛苦的吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMhm...?\d%K%P
「哈、哈啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAll your fortune has turned to ash...\nHow on earth can you be so laid-back about it?\d%K%P
「所有的财产都变成灰烬了，\n为什么还这么从容不迫？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, luckily my cash and cards escaped the fire.\nI usually carry all I've got on me, so...\d%K%P
「啊，幸运的是现金和银行卡这些没事。\n我基本上是把所有的财产带在包里走路的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm not sure if that's a smart thing to do.\nYou will make a pickpocket very happy one day.\d%K%P
「你这样…\n要是被人抢了包那不是丢了所有的财产…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dMore importantly... You no longer have anything to do\nwith Osamu, right?\d%K%P
「说到底…\n你和现在的理一点关系都没有了吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShe said it...\d%K%P
「说出来了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're right... But he needs someone to help him right\nnow.\d%K%P
「话是这么说没错…\n但是他现在这样子，生活不能自理啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShe's not even listening...\d%K%P
「没听进去呢…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIt's not like there's a shortage of people who could look\nafter him. We have everyone living in this boarding house,\nand I could hire professional help as well... or even...\nl-look after him myself.\d%K%P
「能照料他的人，简直太多了。\n公寓里的住户就不用说了，就算雇个护理员也是可以的，\n必要的话，那个………我、我也可以」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I really don't think we could inconvenience you any\nfurther than we already have...\d%K%P
「不，这样的话\n就太麻烦大家了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, but I would never refuse to love my neighbor, in\nevery sense of the word.\d%K%P
「我也是会好好疼爱你邻居的哦」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYou're not helping, so shut up.\d%K%P
「你要不是我这边的，就不要说话」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat's with this three-way deadlock?\d%K%P
「这样的三国局面是啥啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBesides, Osamu must feel very uncomfortable being looked\nafter by someone who's already -divorced- him.\d%K%P
「而且理先生的话…\n一直麻烦已经分开的前妻，\n很多地方也会觉得十分尴尬吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're absolutely right that this might be awkward for\nhim, but it was my fault that he got injured, so...\d%K%P
「嗯，他也是这么觉得的。\n但是，他之所以受伤还是因为我」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat a convenient interpretation of events...\d%K%P
「这个解释有够圆滑啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'll leave once Osamu recovers. I might inadvertently\ncause you trouble in the future, but I hope we can learn\nhow to live together, at least for a short while.\d%K%P
「等理的伤治好了我就走。\n所以这段时间可能会麻烦你们了，\n今后还请多多关照啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOut of the question!\d%K%P
「岂有此理！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOuch!\d%K%P
「哎呀」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOr rather, Teach...\nYou're not even planning to hear us out, are you?\d%K%P
「…反正老师你这是没有商量的意思咯？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dU-Um... I'm sorry...?\d%K%P
「那、那个…对不起？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「…哈啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAre you finished yet?\nI'm kinda done with Osamu's dinner, you know.\d%K%P
「话说完了么？\n理君的饭已经做好了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm sorry, Mitoko.\nWe even made you cook for us.\d%K%P
「抱歉啊美都子。\n麻烦你准备饭了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's all right. I was making it for everyone.\nAnyway, I'll be bringing it down to him.\d%K%P
「没什么，顺手而已…\n那我给他送过去了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou have my deepest apologies, but it's time for Osamu to\nhave his dinner, so I'll be taking my leave.\d%K%P
「所以说，不好意思啊，\n既然到理吃饭的时间了，这事就先放一边吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHahh...\d%K%P
「哈啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Don't let us hold you back.\d%K%P
「…辛苦了～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, and Ms. Sawashima...\nI hope I'm not too out of line for asking this of you,\nbut...\d%K%P
「啊…还有，泽嶋小姐。\n其实我有一个不情之请…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...What do you want?\d%K%P
「…啥？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWould you mind if we made use of the bath in your house\nfor a while? I can't take Osamu to the public bath when\nhe's in this state.\d%K%P
「贵宅的浴室，能借我用用么？\n理这段时间应该是去不了澡堂了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWh-Wh-Wh... Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!\d%K%P
「什、什、什…什什什什！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, I'm sorry. I suppose it was bit of a shameless\nrequest. I was hoping I could at least wash his hair\nproperly, but...\d%K%P
「啊，对不起，果然是有点强人所难。\n至少能帮他洗个头也好啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYou were intending to get in there with him?!\d%K%P
「而且完全就打算一起洗澡！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, what else can I do? It was my own fault he got\ninjured to start with, after all.\d%K%P
「那也是没有办法的事。\n因为害他受伤的是我啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat is such a convenient interpretation, I can't\neven...\d%K%P
「多么方便好用的事实啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWh-Wh-Wh... Why, you...!\d%K%P
「你、你、你…你…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Is it too much to ask? I can only do so much with\nnothing but wet towels.\d%K%P
「…不行么？\n只是擦拭身体总归是洗不干净的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dTake a step back already!!\d%K%P
「给我稍微退步一点啊！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dC'mon, just give up. There's no way we can win this.\nLet's at least try to compromise by making her wear a\nswimsuit or something.\d%K%P
「败了败了。败给你们了。\n好歹让她穿着泳衣，这样两边都能妥协了吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dUgh... Ughghghghghg!\d%K%P
「（强忍着怒火）～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dCan you at least consider it? We'll reimburse you for any\ngas and water costs, of course.\d%K%P
「可以考虑一下么？\n当然水费电费我会出的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dFine, then! If it'll make you shut the hell up, then go\nright ahead and use it!\d%K%P
「别再说了！\n爱怎么用怎么用吧！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, thank you so much! This is great news! Osamu will be\nglad to hear this as well!\d%K%P
「啊，多谢。\n太好了，理肯定也会很乐意的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHahh... Hahh... Hahh...\nI... can't... I'm going to... explode...\d%K%P
「哈～、哈啊～、哈啊啊啊啊～…\n不、不行了，到极限了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIn any case, I'll be returning to my room.\nI think we'll come over around eight in the evening.\d%K%P
「那，我就回房间了。\n８点左右再来打扰」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey, Teach.\nThere's one little thing I want you to tell us.\d%K%P
「呐，老师。\n我想问一下…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYes?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHow come you're suddenly obsessed enough with Osamu to\nthe point of not even trying to hide it?\d%K%P
「你这样，毫无顾忌地照顾理君，\n是为什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's... because it's my fault he got--\d%K%P
「就是说，因为我的错…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDo you feel it's your responsibility as his ex-wife?\nOr is it really just because you got him injured?\nOr could it be... penance for having left him in the\ngutter?\d%K%P
「前妻的义务感？\n让人受伤的责任感？\n对被自己抛弃男人的赎罪？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOr is it... something else entirely?\d%K%P
「还是说…\n这之外的别的东西？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWh-What...?\d%K%P
「等、等等…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou can't answer?\d%K%P
「回答不上来？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「是啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo... I guess it's all of the above, then?\d%K%P
「大概是…因为包含了全部吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWha...\d%K%P
「啥…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「…呼」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat the hell was that...?\d%K%P
「这是啥啊，这…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat was... pretty hardcore.\nI didn't think ol' Teach had it in her.\d%K%P
「干得漂亮啊…老师。\n之前真没想到她是这么沉着冷静的一个人…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
