When I heard the news, I jumped to my feet, even\nforgetting that I had my cast on... My screams echoed\nacross the district like we were in the middle of the\nAlps.%K%P
我在房间里知道了这情况，\n没有扶拐杖就一下站了起来，\n结果发出了感觉都能传到阿尔卑斯山的悲鸣声。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
