My right hand got pulled inside the futon.%K%P
右手被拽到了被子里…%K%P
I obviously couldn't see it from this perspective, but I\nimagine it was currently inside her undone pajamas,\ntouching the skin of her belly directly.%K%P
从这里开始就看不到了，只能用想象来陈述。\n我的手掌滑入敞开的睡衣中。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNmm... phwah...\d%K%P
「…唔啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-Ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊…」%K%P
Her belly, which I was probably touching for the first\ntime in my life, was cold enough to make my fingers feel\nsomewhat chilly, but its softness and smoothness exceeded\nall my expectations.%K%P
刚开始碰到的地方，是都子的腹部（大概），\n我的手掌感觉有些凉，\n那种柔软和光滑，远远超出想象。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYour hand is so... warm.\d%K%P
