%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Not wanting to waste any time being dumbfounded by this\nunimaginable situation, I slowly began stroking her belly\nwithout realizing it myself.%K%P
我并没有沉迷于那样堪为天人的触感，\n在自己都没有注意到的时候，\n已经开始慢慢地抚摸都子的腹部了。%K%P
Perhaps it was my instinct as her guardian -- wanting to\nliberate her from all pain -- that guided my hand.%K%P
