My thumb met her belly button a few times, making me\nconscious of the fact that I was touching a girl.\nNonetheless, I did my best to continue giving her warmth.%K%P
有时候，大拇指会伸入到都子的肚脐之中，\n会突然惊觉，这原来是女孩子的身体，\n即便如此，我也还是集中精神，拼命将体温送过去。%K%P
I'd be a complete failure of a guardian if I kept getting\nflustered over common things like this.%K%P
