But Toko wasn't completely without blame, letting out\nweird moans to distra-- No, it was wrong of me to divert\nthe blame to others at my age.%K%P
但是，这是时不时发出奇怪声音的都子的问题吧…\n不行，不能这样把责任转嫁给都子。%K%P
...%K%P
