After all, no matter how many classes I skipped, there\nweren't any parents around who'd reprimand or worry about\nme.%K%P
反正，就算我再怎么不去学校，\n责骂我、担心我的父母也不在我身边。%K%P
All I had to do was say that I'd stay home for the day,\nand our housekeeper would contact the school for me and\ncook spaghetti for lunch with barely a word.%K%P
