%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou who prepared dinner tonight.\d%K%P
「是麻实你做的吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEeeeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶诶诶！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThought so...\nYou know, it's hard to eat when you keep staring at me.\d%K%P
「果然是啊…\n不过就算如此，被你这么盯着我也很难下咽啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm sorry! Mitoko said she had a study group today, so...\nAh, I thought it was okay since it was at Ms. Hasegawa's\nhouse. You have met Ms. Hasegawa before, right? She's\nMitoko's--\d%K%P
「对不起！因为美都子说了要去学习会我才代做的。\n啊，学习会在长谷川同学家里所以没问题的。\n长谷川同学你见过的吧？美都子的好朋友」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, I have, but...\d%K%P
「不，所以说…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI didn't tell you because I figured you'd lose your\nappetite if you learned it was made by me... Also, my\ncooking repertoire pales in comparison to Mitoko's, so...\d%K%P
「没有跟理说是因为，\n总觉得要是跟你说了这是我做的你肯定就没食欲了，\n而且我不太擅长做饭，跟美都子比肯定是不如她…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not what I was trying to say...\d%K%P
「我不是那个意思…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...How did you know?\d%K%P
「…那为什么注意到了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt was a nostalgic taste. At least to me.\d%K%P
「因为…是很怀念的味道。\n对我而言非常怀念的味道」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Salisbury steak with cheese, omelette, and pasta salad.\nPlus some vegetable sticks, a bread roll, and a croissant.%K%P
奶酪汉堡、没包东西的蛋卷、意面沙拉。\n蔬菜卷、奶油卷和牛角面包。%K%P
I could tell at first sight.%K%P
只要看一眼就知道了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo there's no way it could be bad.\n...Or rather, it's delicious.\d%K%P
「根本就没有不合口味这一回事。\n…倒不如说，每一种都非常好吃」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理…」%K%P
Toko's cooking was likely closer to what people usually\ncalled a \dhomely flavor.\d%K%P
其实，都子所做的料理，\n味道更接近一般家庭里母亲的手艺。%K%P
Both in terms of the natural balance of nutrients and raw\nskill, Toko had a clear advantage.%K%P
在营养均衡方面，用的时间方面，技巧方面，\n都子无论哪个都是具有压倒性优势的。%K%P
However, I was brought up on spaghetti and bread.\nI grew this tall without rice on my menu.%K%P
但是，我是被意面和面包喂大的，\n从小时候开始就完全不吃米饭。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThe first thing that shattered my confidence after I\nmoved here was the cooking...\d%K%P
「理受伤之后，我到这里来，\n最开始受到打击的，就是吃饭了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko is special...\d%K%P
「都子是特别的…」%K%P
Even without accounting for her age, Toko's cooking was\npretty much on a professional level in terms of taste and\nappearance alike. She'd have no trouble being a splendid\nhousewife.%K%P
虽然这话不该我来说，\n但撇开年龄不谈，都子做的饭菜，\n不管是颜色味道都是无可挑剔的，那是无论何时都可以出嫁的水平。%K%P
...I really didn't want to see that happening anytime\nsoon, though.%K%P
…虽然不愿意去想那个场景就是了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's true... but the most shocking part was that I saw\nyou actually eating rice, and even asking for seconds.\d%K%P
「那倒也是啊…\n不过最让我震惊的是，理居然吃和食了。\n米饭…添了好几碗」%K%P
\dIn short, Mitokondria!\d%K%P
『名曰“美都子炒饭”！』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've only recently started eating it.\nUm... Maybe my taste changed as I got older.\d%K%P
「我一直到最近才逐渐接受和食的。\n那个…大概是随着年龄增长，嗜好改变了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo, I'm confident this is her achievement and no one\nelse's.\nAlthough, I'm sure you know that better than anyone.\d%K%P
「不对…是她的力量哦。\n嘛，要说理你才是最清楚的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I certainly did.%K%P
当然，我自然是最清楚的。%K%P
She started by incorporating rice into western food in a\nway I couldn't even tell.%K%P
从最初没有一点米味的『用大米做的西餐』开始。%K%P
With that method, she gradually made my body accept our\nnational food.%K%P
后来慢慢不把米饭压碎，味道也和米饭逐渐靠近，\n慢慢而稳固地把习惯改了过来。%K%P
It was not something that could have been achieved without\nboth passion and patience. She truly worried about me, and\ndid everything within her power to...%K%P
这是如果不脚踏实地、没有热情就不可能完成的任务。\n她真的是很关心我，非常关心我…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI couldn't change you. I was too busy learning the kind\nof dishes that I knew you would enjoy. ...Like today.\d%K%P
「我没能改变理。\n为了做出你不讨厌的料理就已经尽全力了。\n…就像今天一样」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, that's just like you, right?\nIt was always very relaxing to be with you.\d%K%P
「可是，那才是麻实吧？\n跟你在一起，我总是很开心」%K%P
We were comfortable being at each other's side.%K%P
我们总是希望对方能活得比以前更快乐轻松。%K%P
We never had a problem with what the other did and let\neach other live our lives the way we wanted to, believing\nthat our own actions would be accepted just as warmly.%K%P
不讨厌对方的所作所为，\n也并没有想要给对方添堵。%K%P
She would be by my side when I needed her, and would\ndisappear before I knew it when I was in the mood to be\nalone for a while.%K%P
身边想要有人的时候对方就会在身边，\n想要一个人的时候对方不知道什么时候就消失了。%K%P
She would reach out to me when I wanted to touch her, and\nexpectantly close her eyes when I thought about kissing\nher.%K%P
想要牵手的时候对方就会把手伸过来，\n想要接吻的时候，对方就会把眼睛闭上。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's why we never grew up. We trapped each other in\ntepid self-satisfaction and refused to move forward. We\nthought that the status quo was our happiness.\d%K%P
「所以我们两人都没有成长。\n一直不想从温水中跳出来，\n最重要的是什么都没有改变，我觉得」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWas that... such a bad thing?\d%K%P
「那个，是不可以的…么？」%K%P
I was always comfortable with Asami by my side.\nI'm pretty sure I was both satisfied and happy back then.%K%P
跟麻实在一起，总是很安心，\n所以那个时候，我是十分满足的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTry posing that question to your current self. The you\nthat crawled back up from the depths of despair for the\nsake of a girl you otherwise would have never met.\d%K%P
「这个得问现在的理了吧？\n被那孩子鼓励、为了那孩子\n拼命从深渊往上爬的你，是吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Being with Toko wasn't all fun and games. I had to face\nmany a tough situation and endure a fair share of pain and\nshame. It was a far cry from what one could unreservedly\nlabel as \dcomfortable,\d at any rate.%K%P
跟都子在一起，我感到前所未有的辛苦、艰难，\n还有伤痛、害羞，种种难过而又难以忘怀的心情，\n痛苦时流泪，无助时哀叹，得到前忐忑，失去后坦然。%K%P
And that was why I wanted to fight for it. I felt like\ngrabbing my life by the horns.%K%P
也许正因为如此，现在的我，\n才会想要更加坚强地生活下去。%K%P
I wanted to get my right leg out of this cast as soon as\npossible, and return to my company -- my battlefield.%K%P
把这不能动的右脚治好，\n哪怕早一会儿也好，想尽早回到社会里奋斗。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMy past self would never have won against her.\nI possessed neither the power nor the confidence to change\nyou.\d%K%P
「过去的我，对比现在的她，真的是完败。\n对于是不是拥有改变你的力量，我也没有自信」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't win against her now.\nToko is on a level of her own.\d%K%P
「即便是我，也还是赢不了她。\n都子太厉害了」%K%P
Now I could understand why Asami divorced me.%K%P
事到如今，我总算理解了当时麻实为什么强硬地提出分手。%K%P
If we stayed together, neither of us would have ever grown\nup.%K%P
那个时候的我们，在一起是不会成长的。%K%P
We probably wouldn't have fallen into an abyss of misery\nright away, but we might have slowly sunk into it like a\nswamp.%K%P
突然有个重大打击的话，\n大概就会像蚁狮一样，慢慢消沉下去。%K%P
But the current Asami...%K%P
但是，如果是现在的麻实…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'll try making something with rice next time.\n...I doubt I'll be able to make it as tasty as Mitoko,\nthough.\d%K%P
「下次做料理的时候，我试着挑战一下适合米饭的菜的吧。\n…虽然我觉得没有办法做得和美都子一样好吃就是了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere's nothing you can do about that. Toko had years of\nexperience before she reached this level.\d%K%P
「那也是没有办法的事。\n都子可是经过多年修炼的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI was hoping you would at least try to deny it...\d%K%P
「这么直接的肯定，还真是让人不甘心啊」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIt sure has gotten cold lately.\d%K%P
「果然是变冷了啊～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, it's almost the Yule month already.\n...Although the Wild Hunt might have started early this\nyear.\d%K%P
「都已经腊月了嘛。\n…在家里我也是独自走来走去的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...You sometimes sound like a person from another age.\d%K%P
「…你真是像上了年纪似的呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, forgive me for being good at history and ancient\nmyths.\nI can solve a problem that takes you hours in one minute.\d%K%P
「那还真是对不起啊，反正我就是擅长古文了。\n一分钟我就能解决你需要一个小时思考的问题」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dUh, I'm sorry. It was a waste of time for you, wasn't\nit?\d%K%P
「啊，对不起。\n今天晚上浪费阳坂的时间了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, it's not like I really mind, provided I'm not\ntricked to begin with.\d%K%P
「这倒也没什么～。\n如果你没有搞这种暗算的话～」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dSorry about that too...\nI asked Hasegawa to do that for me.\d%K%P
「再次道歉…\n这是我拜托长谷川的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI thought you already had your sports scholarship.\nWhat's the point of suddenly starting to study?\d%K%P
「你不是已经被推荐体育特长生入学了么？\n现在还有必要努力学习么？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYou do realize that studying was never my goal, right?\d%K%P
「学习不是目的，我说了好几遍了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIs that really something you wanna say to someone who\nspent the entire evening teaching you, hm?\d%K%P
「居然对拼命教你的人说这样的话？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dYeah, and it helped me a great deal. Thanks. And for the\nrecord, I don't give my thanks to just everyone.\d%K%P
「嗯，学习这个事谢谢你。\n不过我先声明，这样的感谢可不是经常有的哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see the concept of shame is completely alien to you...\d%K%P
「你脸皮还真是厚…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIf you feel like you wasted your time, be honest and tell\nme.\nI'll make sure to improve.\d%K%P
「既然是浪费时间那我直接说好了。\n…下回来的时候我会改善的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThe same trick won't work on me twice.\d%K%P
「同一个招式可不能用两次哦？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIt's okay, next time I'll invite you myself. If you don't\ncompletely hate the idea, come over sometime.\d%K%P
「没关系。下回就堂堂正正邀请你。\n…要是不讨厌，觉得还行，那就再来吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dAlthough, I guess my house was a bit too noisy for\nstudying today. ...In no small part thanks to my mom.\d%K%P
「嘛，要说是学习会的话未免也太热闹了。\n…我妈也真是」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYour mother seemed like a fun person.\d%K%P
「尾关的母亲，真是个快活的人啊」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dDon't think she was fired up simply because I brought a\ngirl over to the house. She's actually always like\nthat...\d%K%P
「那个啊，你要觉得那是因为我把女生带回家\n而让她情绪高涨，那就大错特错了。\n她平常就是那样的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha, I imagine your house is always in party mode,\nthen.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈，热闹点不也很好么」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI wish she'd cool down, honestly. I can't believe she\ntold you all those embarrassing things about me.\d%K%P
「有时候都会想“饶了我吧”…\n也不管我好不好意思，在那一个劲说我的黑历史」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah... Who knew that up until the late years of\nelementary school, you still...\d%K%P
「确实是啊…\n莫非你真的一直到小学高年级还…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dDon't say any more! You're about to infringe on the\nPersonal Information Protection Law!\d%K%P
「打住打住！\n你有违反个人信息保护法的嫌疑！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen allow me to add an annotation that I shall only use\nthis sensitive information to make fun of you personally.\d%K%P
「那来加个注释。\n我只会以调戏你为目的，\n使用你的个人信息」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dUh...\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I won't tell anyone, though I can't speak for Rinko.\d%K%P
「…我不会对别人说的。\n至于伦子我就不知道了」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI'm begging you, Hinosaka... I'm in a delicate situation\nmyself with all those recommendations and whatnot.\d%K%P
「求你了，阳坂…\n我这可是在等待推荐生审核的关键时期」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDon't worry, no school will strip you of a scholarship\njust because you slept in the same bed as your mother\nuntil the late years of elementary school.\d%K%P
「又不会因为你一直到小学高年级还和父母一起睡觉，\n就把你的推荐资格取消掉」%K%P
