Asami gazed at that embarrassing photograph with seemingly\ngenuine joy in her eyes.%K%P
玲珑小脸上映衬出十分开心样子的麻实，\n目不转睛地盯着那张令人害羞与感慨的照片，\n那时的我们没有想过，现在的怀念竟是如此简简单单。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's so nostalgic...\nI was still calling you Yoshimura at that time, right?\d%K%P
