Or one year after we started living together.%K%P
顺便说一下，那是在同居一年之后。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see... I guess I was more aggressive back then. I\nconfessed first, and it was my idea to stay at your room\nin the beginning, and...\d%K%P
