It was all the otherwise introverted Asami. She alone\npushed our relationship forward.%K%P
那时麻实是多么保守啊，\n但她竟突然做好了『破罐子破摔』的觉悟，\n然后这才让我们的关系有所进展。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dRight, do you remember the first thing we talked about\nduring that matchmaking party where we met?\d%K%P
