「名是理对吧？\nＯＳＡＭＵ（理）和ＡＳＡＭＩ（麻实）的子音是一样的呢，\n从那开始就打开了话匣子…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's so silly...\d%K%P
「还真是无聊啊…」%K%P
Asami actually remembered something that happened ages\nago, while I continued faking ignorance.%K%P
居然还能记得这么久远无聊事情的麻实也是，\n明明什么都历历在目却故意装糊涂的我也是…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIn retrospect... yeah, it was pretty dumb.\nBut at the time, I was desperate to somehow get your\nattention.\d%K%P
