「哎呀？」%K%P
Asami gave me a mischievous look.%K%P
像是要戏弄我似的，麻实抬起头看向我的侧脸。%K%P
Having discerned the correct meaning of my words, she\nslowly placed her hand on my still-moist hair.%K%P
她应该完全理解了我话语里所吐露的真心，\n摸向了我洗过的头发。%K%P
The same hair that she ended up washing for me, even\nthough both my arms were doing just fine.%K%P
那是明明自己两只手都还好使，却让麻实给洗的头发。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, so there were other girls, after all.\nMakes me wonder what's so good about a coward like you.\d%K%P
