And despite understanding what I really meant, she twisted\nmy words into a silly joke again.%K%P
然后，明明她应该完全理解了我话语里所吐露的真心，\n却还要专门吐错槽点来打马虎眼。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahaha... It feels so nostalgic to think back to those\ndays... Back when we were neither married nor divorced.\d%K%P
