%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami...\d%K%P
「麻实…」%K%P
Her consideration, and this stable sense of distance...\nwas in despairingly perfect sync with my heart.%K%P
挂虑和适度的距离感交织在一起，\n果然和我的心…绝望地相合了。%K%P
We gazed at the ceiling, our old stories seemingly without\nend.\nA comfortable time I almost wished would last forever.%K%P
我们仰望着天花板，\n聊着没完没了的往事。\n这样的时间要是能一直持续下去，那该多好。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dStill... I don't know exactly when it happened, but one\nday, I started seeing how lonely and fragile you were.\d%K%P
「但是啊，是从什么时候开始的呢…\n你逐渐被寂寞和脆弱给困住…」%K%P
She was the one who left me, yet I felt the guilt of it.%K%P
明明是被她抛弃的…\n现在我却产生反而是我抛弃了她的罪恶感。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI kept thinking about you... and realized I was not doing\nthe right thing by simply loving you.\d%K%P
「越来越在意你，越来越在意你…\n到后来感觉已经不能只是去喜欢你了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I think it was around the time I graduated that I\nstarted noticing how much stronger you'd become.\d%K%P
