As time passed, the friction between us escalated.%K%P
对我的干预也稍稍增加了。%K%P
She grew more and more assertive and demonstrated a strong\nwill and a refusal to back down during our arguments.%K%P
意见不一致的时候，\n坚强或者是顽固让她一直到最后的最后都不退让。%K%P
She would be my emotional crutch while I still had trouble\ngetting used to my job, but wouldn't hesitate to reprimand\nme whenever I stepped out of line.%K%P
她温柔地治愈了第一次工作不习惯而筋疲力尽的我，\n同时也认真地对我叱责和激励。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI feared you might leave me one day, and figured marriage\nwould be the answer...\d%K%P
