The situation was slightly different from before, but the\nair of soothing comfort she would shower me with remained\nexactly the same.%K%P
和过去稍微有点不同，\n但这跨越几年时光后又赐予我的太多太多温柔与坦然，\n确是一点也没有变的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI thought I'd give birth to a child, raise them... and\nthat this would turn you into the loving father I wanted.\d%K%P
