Asami loved children.%K%P
麻实是像一般人那样喜欢小孩子的。%K%P
She got a degree at the Education Department and acquired\nher teaching license for that simple reason.%K%P
就是因为这么平淡的理由，\n她从师范学院毕业后拿到了教师资格证。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
