It was a question I could only ask now -- only after we\nhad already met, hooked up, got married, and divorced\naccording to her wishes, then met again and made up.%K%P
那样的话，两个人相遇，两个人日久生情，然后稳定下来。\n后来遂她愿离了婚，又再见面、言归于好，\n这些事情就不会发生了吧…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you think it would have been different...?\d%K%P
