%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-Sure...\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊…」%K%P
Asami wanted to show me what raising a child meant.%K%P
麻实是希望带给我养育孩子的现实的吧。%K%P
Because that was something I had never experienced during\nmy own childhood.%K%P
因为在我自己成长的过程中，\n并没有感受过那样的事。%K%P
Much like how people that didn't understand pain acted\nviolent, or how those that failed to comprehend the value\nof life ended up taking their own...%K%P
就像不知道疼痛的人使用暴力一样， \n就像承受不起生命重量的人轻易结束自己生命一样。%K%P
Asami noticed how I too was, in a sense, warped. She made\nan attempt to fix it, hoping it would lead me towards a\nhappier future.%K%P
她察觉到了我内心的阴暗之处，\n说是多管闲事也好吧，她想要将其纠正，\n让我变得幸福起来。%K%P
But her goal was too much of a burden for her alone. She\nbuckled under its weight, her heart suffering a wound that\nwould never mend.%K%P
但那高远的志向，最后让她自己都没有承受下来。\n受过一次伤的心，没有能再次恢复力量。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
Well, that was important and everything, but...%K%P
哎，嘛，先不管这些事情…%K%P
