I woke up in the middle of the night several times due to\nhaving difficulty breathing, so even the dim sunlight of\nthis winter morning felt like a blinding beam to my\nexhausted eyes.%K%P
夜里数度呼吸困难、刚刚睁开眼，\n即使窗户透进来冬日清晨的柔和日光已然不怎么强烈了，\n但我还是感觉太过晃眼。%K%P
My memories, reality itself, and the figments of my own\nimagination melded into one incomprehensible mess, forcing\nany and all thoughts about the dream I'd just had out of\nmy mind.%K%P
直到刚才还在做的梦境，被完全驱散了。\n那一半是怀念往昔，一半也许是憧憬的梦，\n舍弃了又失而复得的现实，在脑海里混作一团。%K%P
