我，绝对是惹都子生气了。%K%P
In fact, just getting into that accident should have been\nenough to trigger her wrath. Similarly, I had yet to\nreceive a single slap, despite everything that was going\non with Asami.%K%P
因为，我受伤这个事，就已经让她十分不快了。\n而在麻实的问题上，就算被她扇多少巴掌也不奇怪。%K%P
