But these days, Toko's features would twist into an\nambiguous smile that felt nothing like the girl I came to\nknow.%K%P
尽管如此，\n最近都子净做出些奇怪的表情，然后露出暧昧的微笑，\n看起来不像是我熟知的都子会做出来的表情。%K%P
I felt somewhat disheartened and lonely from seeing Toko\ntake a step towards adulthood in a way I did not\nparticularly approve of.%K%P
都子似乎并没有朝着我所期望的方向成熟起来，\n这让我感觉有些寂寞。%K%P
