For the first time in a while, I felt a peculiar kind of\nwarmth spread across my chest... Although it could've been\none of their usual pranks again. I wasn't quite sure.%K%P
总觉得我似乎又久违地感受到了大家带来的温暖，\n那种微妙的感觉渐渐地涌上心头，真令人无奈。%K%P
Well, that aside, it was just like the tenants of the\nTerrace House Hinosaka to casually celebrate and support\nthe happiness of others.%K%P
嘛，那个暂且不说，不过就这样简单地把自己的运气\n转交给别人的这几位，\n他们果然是Terrace House阳之坂的住户们啊。%K%P
