Still, the issue of who I would invite was indeed an\nimportant matter to consider if I wanted to make the most\nof the ticket.%K%P
不过话说回来，邀请谁这确实是个问题，\n如何有效利用这一张券的重要问题。%K%P
Who did I cause the most trouble with my recent mishaps?\nWho did I want to express my gratitude to the most...?%K
这回我受伤，最麻烦了谁…\n最应该向谁报答呢…？%K
